WEBVTT

00:05.380 --> 00:06.830
<b>...and that is our report.</b>

00:07.670 --> 00:09.750
<b>Against three of the elite Numbers...</b>

00:10.170 --> 00:11.540
<b>John Smith...</b>

00:11.540 --> 00:12.920
<b>I don't know that name.</b>

00:13.210 --> 00:15.460
<b>Could he be a new member of
the Named Children?</b>

00:15.790 --> 00:17.000
<b>I don't know.</b>

00:17.500 --> 00:19.880
<b>It's also possible he's a resident of the Lawless City.</b>

00:20.330 --> 00:21.580
<b>The Black Tower's influence is-</b>

00:21.580 --> 00:24.080
<b>John Smith's skill is leagues above
even the most skilled of fighters!</b>

00:24.080 --> 00:26.040
<b>It was like he predicted our each and every move!</b>

00:26.170 --> 00:27.380
<b>Hey! You can't do that!</b>

00:27.380 --> 00:28.710
<b>He's as good as the Seven Shadows!</b>

00:28.710 --> 00:29.380
<b>His power is equal to yours!</b>

00:29.380 --> 00:30.750
<b>I said be quiet!
</b><b>His power is equal to yours!</b><b></b>

00:30.750 --> 00:31.960
<b>Let me go face him again!</b>

00:31.960 --> 00:33.460
<b>I am begging you to please read the room!</b>

00:33.460 --> 00:35.040
<b>Number 665, help me out here!</b>

00:35.040 --> 00:36.540
<b>Okay.
</b><b>Let go of me!</b><b></b>

00:36.540 --> 00:37.790
<b>Now it's time for beddy-bye.
</b><b>I'm not done-</b><b></b>

00:37.790 --> 00:39.290
<b>Are you trying to get yourself killed?</b>

00:39.290 --> 00:40.830
<b>Goodnight!</b>

00:41.040 --> 00:42.290
<b>Just settle down!</b>

00:45.880 --> 00:48.290
<b>That's another problem we're
going to have to deal with.</b>

00:48.290 --> 00:51.580
<b>I've assigned Zeta to the search
for what we discussed.</b>

00:52.080 --> 00:55.170
<b>I want to think the fact that she hasn't contacted us
means the mission is going smoothly.</b>

00:55.170 --> 00:58.830
<b>The Cult seems to be putting up
some heavy resistance.</b>

00:59.290 --> 01:03.170
<b>I hope we can put an end to all of this quickly,
so we can take some time to relax together.</b>

01:03.710 --> 01:04.920
<b>Lady Alpha...</b>

01:08.630 --> 01:10.710
<b>We'll send Delta to deal with John Smith.</b>

01:11.710 --> 01:12.920
<b>Indeed.</b>

01:13.580 --> 01:15.250
<b>That would be best.</b>

01:22.710 --> 01:24.790
<b>That is too late</b>

01:24.790 --> 01:27.710
<b>You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
</b><b>Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai</b><b></b>

01:27.710 --> 01:29.830
<b>That is to say...</b>

01:32.790 --> 01:39.000
<b>The first move chooses an unknown future
</b><b>Saisho no itte de erabu michi naru future</b><b></b>

01:39.000 --> 01:41.330
<b>How it will be
</b><b>Sono arisama</b><b></b>

01:41.670 --> 01:42.790
<b>This way</b>

01:42.790 --> 01:49.080
<b>The last move decides the world's answer
</b><b>Saigo no itte de kimeru sekai no answer</b><b></b>

01:49.080 --> 01:51.710
<b>A single winner
</b><b>Hitori no winner</b><b></b>

01:51.710 --> 01:53.080
<b>It's me</b>

01:53.330 --> 01:55.630
<b>These eyes have seen it
</b><b>Kono me wa misueta</b><b></b>

01:57.130 --> 02:02.710
<b>The optimal solution no one has yet been able to discern
</b><b>Dare mo imada mitoosenu saitekikai o</b><b></b>

02:04.000 --> 02:07.790
<b>It's all a game to control the board
</b><b>Subete wa banjou shihai suru game</b><b></b>

02:07.790 --> 02:10.290
<b>A battle of thought
</b><b>Shikou no tousou</b><b></b>

02:10.460 --> 02:12.830
<b>I disguise even my mistakes
</b><b>Mistake sae mo gisou shite</b><b></b>

02:12.830 --> 02:15.420
<b>And even checkmate is a preparatory move
</b><b>Checkmate made fuseki toshite</b><b></b>

02:15.420 --> 02:17.830
<b>A game to take each other's king
</b><b>King o ubaiau game</b><b></b>

02:17.830 --> 02:20.290
<b>Ideology and desire
</b><b>Shisou to yokubou</b><b></b>

02:20.580 --> 02:22.960
<b>A bad move to not let one chance get away
</b><b>One chance minogasanu akushu</b><b></b>

02:22.960 --> 02:25.630
<b>The last chance will cinch it
</b><b>Last chance kanarazu shitomeru</b><b></b>

02:25.920 --> 02:27.920
<b>That is too late</b>

02:27.920 --> 02:30.830
<b>You can't catch up with a move like that anymore
</b><b>Sonna te ja mou oitsukenai</b><b></b>

02:30.830 --> 02:33.000
<b>That is to say</b>

02:33.000 --> 02:37.960
<b>Total victory is in my hands
</b><b>Kanzen shouri wa kono te no naka ni</b><b></b>

02:43.250 --> 02:46.040
<b>No one can catch up now
</b><b>Dare nimo mou oitsukenai</b><b></b>

02:47.170 --> 02:50.040
<b>#06 John Smith</b>

02:50.040 --> 02:50.830
<b>electric carpet</b>

02:50.040 --> 02:50.830
<b>magic powered carpet?</b>

02:50.040 --> 02:50.830
<b>#06 John Smith</b>

02:50.830 --> 02:51.960
<b>electric carpet</b>

02:50.830 --> 02:51.960
<b>magic powered carpet?</b>

03:29.000 --> 03:30.790
<b>You removed my overhead defense.</b>

03:32.130 --> 03:33.750
<b>But it will do you no good.</b>

03:50.040 --> 03:52.920
<b>The fate of a beast is to crawl along the ground.</b>

03:54.920 --> 03:58.540
<b>I knew you people would be
the first to figure it out.</b>

03:59.210 --> 04:00.880
<b>But it's too soon.</b>

04:01.790 --> 04:04.330
<b>Boss!</b>

04:11.750 --> 04:13.540
<b>What brings you here anyway, Delta?</b>

04:13.540 --> 04:15.330
<b>Delta was hunting!</b>

04:15.330 --> 04:17.040
<b>What were you hunting?</b>

04:17.040 --> 04:18.500
<b>John Smith!</b>

04:20.380 --> 04:21.880
<b>Boss is John Smith?</b>

04:21.880 --> 04:23.170
<b>Yeah, I am.</b>

04:24.630 --> 04:27.000
<b>Delta can't beat John Smith!</b>

04:27.000 --> 04:28.920
<b>I'm gonna report to Lady Alpha!</b>

04:28.920 --> 04:31.710
<b>Wait, wait!
I need you to listen carefully, Delta.</b>

04:32.170 --> 04:35.250
<b>I'm in the middle of a hush-hush secret mission.</b>

04:35.250 --> 04:37.630
<b>A hush-hush secret mission?</b>

04:37.630 --> 04:40.630
<b>Yes, a hush-hush secret mission
that can only be accomplished</b>

04:40.630 --> 04:42.710
<b>by a super elite secret agent.</b>

04:42.710 --> 04:43.920
<b>That's so cool!</b>

04:45.460 --> 04:46.750
<b>Delta wants to do it, too!</b>

04:46.750 --> 04:49.170
<b>Nope, this is something only I can do.</b>

04:49.170 --> 04:52.670
<b>And if you report to Alpha about John Smith,</b>

04:52.670 --> 04:55.710
<b>my hush-hush secret mission will end in failure.</b>

04:56.290 --> 04:57.290
<b>Why?</b>

04:57.290 --> 04:59.460
<b>Because it won't be a secret anymore.</b>

04:59.460 --> 05:01.540
<b>So I need you to not tell anyone.</b>

05:01.960 --> 05:04.790
<b>But Delta's on a mission for Lady Alpha...</b>

05:04.790 --> 05:06.080
<b>It's okay.</b>

05:06.080 --> 05:07.960
<b>I'm going to give you a new mission.</b>

05:08.420 --> 05:10.750
<b>You remember the rules of
Shadow Garden, don't you?</b>

05:10.750 --> 05:12.000
<b>I do not!</b>

05:12.000 --> 05:15.670
<b>Any mission I give you
takes priority over anything else.</b>

05:15.670 --> 05:17.540
<b>Even a mission from Alpha.</b>

05:17.540 --> 05:19.460
<b>Lady Alpha won't get mad?</b>

05:19.460 --> 05:20.670
<b>She won't get mad.</b>

05:20.670 --> 05:22.210
<b>She really won't get mad?</b>

05:22.210 --> 05:24.290
<b>She really won't get mad.</b>

05:24.500 --> 05:26.420
<b>After all, this is to save the world.</b>

05:26.420 --> 05:27.710
<b>Save the world?!</b>

05:27.710 --> 05:29.500
<b>That's right, save the world.</b>

05:29.500 --> 05:33.290
<b>So, I'm sorry, but when you finish your mission,
I'll give you something for a reward.</b>

05:33.290 --> 05:34.460
<b>A reward?!</b>

05:34.460 --> 05:36.040
<b>Boss will do anything I want!</b>

05:36.040 --> 05:37.460
<b>No, not anything.</b>

05:37.830 --> 05:41.130
<b>It has to be something I'm capable of,
and something that doesn't take too much effort,</b>

05:41.130 --> 05:42.960
<b>and something that doesn't cost any money.</b>

05:42.960 --> 05:45.000
<b>And then I'll see if I can make it happen.</b>

05:46.290 --> 05:47.790
<b>Boss is gonna do whatever I say!</b>

05:47.790 --> 05:49.210
<b>As long as it satisfies those conditions.</b>

05:49.210 --> 05:50.630
<b>He'll listen to anything I say!</b>

05:50.630 --> 05:52.040
<b>As long as it satisfies those conditions.</b>

05:52.040 --> 05:54.500
<b>Woohoo! I'm going on a mission!</b>

05:55.130 --> 05:57.630
<b>Okay, and your mission is...
Let me think...</b>

05:57.920 --> 06:00.920
<b>If you keep going straight from here,
you'll get to a place called the Lawless City.</b>

06:00.920 --> 06:03.790
<b>There's a Black Tower there,
where there's a big bad guy named Juggernaut.</b>

06:03.790 --> 06:05.420
<b>Go hunt him for me.</b>

06:06.000 --> 06:09.540
<b>Lawless... Black... Jugga Jungle.</b>

06:09.540 --> 06:11.500
<b>Yes, exactly, the Black Jugga Jugga.</b>

06:11.500 --> 06:12.880
<b>And I hunt him.</b>

06:12.880 --> 06:13.880
<b>That's right.</b>

06:13.880 --> 06:15.330
<b>And Boss will do what I say.</b>

06:15.330 --> 06:16.750
<b>As long as it satisfies my conditions.</b>

06:16.750 --> 06:18.330
<b>You'll do anything I say!</b>

06:18.330 --> 06:20.000
<b>As long as it satisfies those conditions.</b>

06:20.000 --> 06:21.290
<b>Got it!</b>

06:21.290 --> 06:22.920
<b>I'm going hunting!</b>

06:25.670 --> 06:27.130
<b>Something seems off about this,</b>

06:27.130 --> 06:29.420
<b>but, oh well, it's to save the world.</b>

06:30.250 --> 06:31.830
<b>And as for Alpha...</b>

06:32.250 --> 06:33.250
<b>It's fine.</b>

06:33.250 --> 06:35.290
<b>I'm sure she'll be home by
the time the weather warms up.</b>

06:40.330 --> 06:41.540
<b>Then Delta...</b>

06:41.830 --> 06:44.460
<b>We found the aftermath of an intense battle.</b>

06:45.130 --> 06:48.080
<b>We believe that's when this...</b>

06:48.880 --> 06:50.080
<b>was cut off.</b>

06:54.080 --> 06:55.630
<b>It's unthinkable...</b>

06:55.630 --> 06:57.960
<b>that she would abandon a mission.</b>

06:58.460 --> 06:59.670
<b>She...</b>

06:59.670 --> 07:00.920
<b>That stupid mutt...</b>

07:00.920 --> 07:03.290
<b>She was stupid, but she never...</b>

07:03.290 --> 07:05.670
<b>She never defied an order from you, Lady Alpha.</b>

07:09.750 --> 07:11.330
<b>Continue the search.</b>

07:12.460 --> 07:14.670
<b>I hope to at least retrieve the body.</b>

07:17.210 --> 07:18.460
<b>Lady Alpha...</b>

07:18.830 --> 07:21.420
<b>The amount of counterfeit bills in
circulation is still increasing.</b>

07:21.710 --> 07:26.000
<b>At this rate, the citizens will begin to doubt
the value of all paper money,</b>

07:26.000 --> 07:29.250
<b>and the wave of demands for redemption
will bear down on everyone,</b>

07:29.250 --> 07:30.500
<b>including Mitsugoshi.</b>

07:30.960 --> 07:33.670
<b>We don't have the assets that will be required
to satisfy the predicted demand.</b>

07:33.670 --> 07:36.670
<b>We need a plan, and urgently.</b>

07:37.080 --> 07:39.920
<b>We must eliminate him...
Get rid of John Smith, and-</b>

07:39.920 --> 07:42.170
<b>This was what he wanted from the start.</b>

07:44.130 --> 07:47.750
<b>This was no shallow attempt to earn
a few extra zeni with counterfeit bills.</b>

07:48.080 --> 07:52.210
<b>While we were fighting a commerce war
with the Major Corporate Alliance,</b>

07:52.210 --> 07:54.000
<b>he was sowing the seeds.</b>

07:54.670 --> 07:57.000
<b>Seeds to intentionally spark a credit crisis,</b>

07:57.000 --> 08:00.630
<b>bankrupt us both, and take everything for himself.</b>

08:00.960 --> 08:03.130
<b>His aim was not for profit generated by the market,</b>

08:03.130 --> 08:06.170
<b>but for the market itself that
constantly generates profit?!</b>

08:06.170 --> 08:08.830
<b>His plan is that ambitious?</b>

08:09.830 --> 08:12.420
<b>John Smith...</b>

08:13.170 --> 08:16.290
<b>The Cult is highly concerned about
the current state of affairs.</b>

08:16.960 --> 08:19.960
<b>If these mysterious counterfeit bills
continue to circulate,</b>

08:19.960 --> 08:24.000
<b>it will expedite the credit collapse,
and the Cult will suffer severe losses.</b>

08:24.500 --> 08:28.130
<b>Mr. Gettan, this is more than a question
of your personal responsi-</b>

08:32.880 --> 08:35.420
<b>John Smith, you say?</b>

08:35.420 --> 08:37.000
<b>Uh, yes, sir!</b>

08:37.000 --> 08:39.380
<b>When we attempted to uncover
the source of the counterfeit bills,</b>

08:39.380 --> 08:42.040
<b>a man calling himself John Smith stood in our way.</b>

08:42.380 --> 08:43.380
<b>Garter...</b>

08:43.380 --> 08:44.420
<b>Y-yes, sir?</b>

08:44.420 --> 08:45.750
<b>Set up checkpoints.</b>

08:45.750 --> 08:48.630
<b>Inspect everything going in and out
of the Royal Capital.</b>

08:49.170 --> 08:50.670
<b>Uh, no, sir!</b>

08:50.670 --> 08:54.000
<b>We may have a lot of clout,
but if we tried that, the royal family would-</b>

08:57.330 --> 09:00.380
<b>Do whatever you must to find
the source of those counterfeit bills.</b>

09:00.380 --> 09:01.750
<b>Y-yes, sir!</b>

09:02.880 --> 09:04.750
<b>Have you heard what the
Major Corporate Alliance is doing?</b>

09:04.750 --> 09:06.380
<b>How they're inspecting every piece of cargo?</b>

09:06.380 --> 09:09.250
<b>The Minister of Transport and
the Commander of the Knights</b>

09:09.250 --> 09:10.710
<b>are both hopping mad about it.</b>

09:10.710 --> 09:13.130
<b>They're not even trying to pretend anymore.</b>

09:14.250 --> 09:17.670
<b>We let some things slide because the economy
was good, but this is crossing a line.</b>

09:17.670 --> 09:18.290
<b>This was... and so...</b>

09:18.290 --> 09:19.500
<b>Alexia?
</b><b>This was... and so...</b><b></b>

09:21.250 --> 09:22.630
<b>Iris!</b>

09:23.420 --> 09:26.790
<b>I know there's no school today,
but I still didn't expect to see you back at the castle.</b>

09:27.290 --> 09:29.670
<b>They haven't finished rebuilding the Academy yet.</b>

09:29.670 --> 09:33.210
<b>So I thought it might be easier to find
specialized books in the palace archives.</b>

09:33.540 --> 09:34.960
<b>Specialized books?</b>

09:34.960 --> 09:36.380
<b>On all kinds of things.</b>

09:36.380 --> 09:39.330
<b>Law, politics, engineering, economics, finance...</b>

09:39.330 --> 09:41.290
<b>Oh, and ancient linguistics, too.</b>

09:42.040 --> 09:44.630
<b>Are you going to give up the sword
and become a scholar?</b>

09:44.630 --> 09:46.000
<b>Not at all.</b>

09:46.000 --> 09:48.790
<b>Rather, this is to help me know
where to wield my sword.</b>

09:49.420 --> 09:53.170
<b>Since this spring,
I've been forced to realize a lot of things.</b>

09:53.710 --> 09:55.880
<b>If I just keep swinging my sword around at random,</b>

09:55.880 --> 09:58.210
<b>that's never going to change anything.</b>

09:58.670 --> 10:00.500
<b>I'll only ever be an outsider.</b>

10:01.500 --> 10:04.080
<b>If I want to wield my sword
in a place where it matters,</b>

10:04.080 --> 10:07.630
<b>then I have to start by earning
the right to stand in that place.</b>

10:07.960 --> 10:12.130
<b>And the road to that place sometimes starts
in an area where you don't wield a sword.</b>

10:12.630 --> 10:14.460
<b>I had to learn that the hard way.</b>

10:15.330 --> 10:18.250
<b>Because of that, now I have no time for anything.</b>

10:18.250 --> 10:20.500
<b>Of course, I can't neglect my training...</b>

10:25.380 --> 10:26.580
<b>Iris?</b>

10:27.880 --> 10:29.290
<b>Rumors of the counterfeit bills</b>

10:29.290 --> 10:31.670
<b>are already beginning to spread
throughout the Royal Capital.</b>

10:33.080 --> 10:35.830
<b>We believe the royal family will be
forced to take action soon.</b>

10:36.460 --> 10:39.210
<b>As expected, setting up unauthorized
checkpoints had a negative impact.</b>

10:39.210 --> 10:42.580
<b>The adverse effects on the marketplace
are immeasurable, and already...</b>

10:42.960 --> 10:43.880
<b>close window when cold</b>

10:42.960 --> 10:43.880
<b>dramatic effect * health</b>

10:42.960 --> 10:43.880
<b>Major Corporate Alliance</b>

10:43.880 --> 10:44.880
<b>close window when cold</b>

10:43.880 --> 10:44.880
<b>dramatic effect * health</b>

10:43.880 --> 10:44.880
<b>Major Corporate Alliance</b>

10:43.880 --> 10:44.880
<b>Bad News</b>

10:45.130 --> 10:46.170
<b>What's wrong?</b>

10:46.170 --> 10:47.170
<b>Oh, it's just...</b>

10:47.170 --> 10:49.330
<b>My Lord, you're taking notes?</b>

10:49.670 --> 10:51.750
<b>Yes, because this will effect the future.</b>

10:51.750 --> 10:53.750
<b>Is the situation really that dire?</b>

10:54.500 --> 10:56.500
<b>My apologies, I'll continue.</b>

10:56.500 --> 10:57.790
<b>Keep it brief.</b>

10:57.790 --> 11:00.420
<b>Because these circumstances can
easily lead to inflation,</b>

11:00.420 --> 11:02.710
<b>it has already reached a point that it
must be addressed at a state level.</b>

11:02.710 --> 11:05.380
<b>It doesn't make sense.</b>

11:02.710 --> 11:05.630
<b>counterfeit banknotes in circulation</b>

11:02.710 --> 11:05.630
<b>royal family -* mint more coins</b>

11:02.710 --> 11:05.630
<b>all reten retain holdings</b>

11:02.710 --> 11:05.630
<b>rate of inflation 7.2%</b>

11:02.710 --> 11:05.630
<b>2 degrees below freezing</b>

11:05.880 --> 11:07.290
<b>Is there a mistake in my report?</b>

11:07.290 --> 11:09.330
<b>We'll restart the investigation
and analysis right away.</b>

11:09.330 --> 11:10.670
<b>No, there's no time to spare.</b>

11:10.670 --> 11:12.830
<b>Let's just proceed as we have been.</b>

11:13.460 --> 11:14.960
<b>I am deeply sorry about this.</b>

11:16.210 --> 11:18.790
<b>If I may, there's one more thing.</b>

11:19.880 --> 11:22.630
<b>Something I must report...</b>

11:23.500 --> 11:25.580
<b>To deal with John Smith, we...</b>

11:25.960 --> 11:28.670
<b>We sent Delta after him.</b>

11:29.630 --> 11:33.290
<b>As a result, we've lost all contact with her.</b>

11:33.960 --> 11:36.330
<b>We believe she may have been killed in action.</b>

11:36.330 --> 11:37.170
<b>What?</b>

11:37.170 --> 11:38.170
<b>What?</b>

11:39.170 --> 11:40.580
<b>Oh, nothing.</b>

11:40.580 --> 11:41.830
<b>No, wait.</b>

11:41.830 --> 11:43.040
<b>I mean...</b>

11:43.170 --> 11:44.540
<b>Delta is...</b>

11:44.540 --> 11:46.710
<b>Yeah, Delta has...</b>

11:47.210 --> 11:49.920
<b>merely gone somewhere far away, that's all.</b>

11:52.880 --> 11:54.670
<b>Yes, of course.</b>

11:55.000 --> 11:58.710
<b>Delta has only gone somewhere far away, that's all.</b>

11:59.500 --> 12:01.330
<b>Is she hibernating, or what?</b>

12:02.080 --> 12:04.290
<b>John Smith is a considerably skilled fighter.</b>

12:04.580 --> 12:06.750
<b>If possible, Lord Shadow, we would like you to...</b>

12:06.750 --> 12:08.960
<b>Apologies, but I have matters to attend to.</b>

12:08.960 --> 12:10.630
<b>Of course, I understand.</b>

12:11.040 --> 12:13.000
<b>I'm sorry for asking too much.</b>

12:15.750 --> 12:18.080
<b>My Lord, about those notes...</b>

12:18.290 --> 12:21.500
<b>As you know, we have a rule that classified documents</b>

12:21.500 --> 12:24.170
<b>must either be destroyed or encrypted without delay.</b>

12:25.830 --> 12:27.040
<b>Read it.</b>

12:27.040 --> 12:28.330
<b>What?!</b>

12:28.330 --> 12:30.250
<b>Such a complex code!</b>

12:30.500 --> 12:32.170
<b>Did you develop this all on your own?</b>

12:32.170 --> 12:35.960
<b>Hiragana, katakana, kanji,
Arabic numerals, Roman letters...</b>

12:36.630 --> 12:39.420
<b>It uses five different languages that
I developed independently.</b>

12:39.420 --> 12:41.420
<b>I'd love for you to teach me!</b>

12:41.420 --> 12:42.630
<b>Maybe I will.</b>

12:44.080 --> 12:47.710
<b>If you can decipher the meaning of this text,
I will enlighten you.</b>

12:48.250 --> 12:50.960
<b>I will share a part of my wisdom with- achoo!</b>

12:56.000 --> 12:57.920
<b>flavor</b>

12:56.000 --> 12:57.920
<b>(eggs) salt, vinegar, oil?</b>

12:56.000 --> 12:57.920
<b>soybeans, salt</b>

12:56.000 --> 12:57.920
<b>mix together</b>

12:56.000 --> 12:57.920
<b>soak in water?</b>

12:56.000 --> 12:57.920
<b>soy sauce                                     probably mash it</b>

12:56.010 --> 12:57.920
<b>pickle it?</b>

12:59.210 --> 13:00.420
<b>Mr. Smith...</b>

13:01.000 --> 13:03.750
<b>We are approaching the
Major Corporate Alliance checkpoint.</b>

13:06.500 --> 13:07.960
<b>Keep going.</b>

13:08.250 --> 13:10.290
<b>And we're really allowed to just take it out?</b>

13:10.290 --> 13:12.290
<b>If they don't stop, make sure they have an "accident."</b>

13:12.290 --> 13:13.580
<b>Those are our orders.</b>

13:13.580 --> 13:15.670
<b>But there's no way the Knights would just let us-</b>

13:15.670 --> 13:16.960
<b>We got no choice!</b>

13:16.960 --> 13:19.580
<b>If we don't do what they say,
our lives in the black market are over!</b>

13:19.580 --> 13:20.790
<b>I don't care how big he is.</b>

13:20.790 --> 13:23.080
<b>When you get down to it,
Garter's just a regular merchant.</b>

13:23.290 --> 13:25.170
<b>Not him, dammit.</b>

13:25.170 --> 13:26.790
<b>Garter's backed by-</b>

13:34.710 --> 13:35.920
<b>Bro...</b>

13:36.330 --> 13:37.630
<b>We go into hiding.</b>

13:37.630 --> 13:39.670
<b>If we're lucky, we'll survive.</b>

13:40.380 --> 13:42.500
<b>As long as those monsters don't find us.</b>

13:51.380 --> 13:53.580
<b>It's a pleasure to meet you, John Smith.</b>

13:53.920 --> 13:55.420
<b>Now goodbye.</b>

13:58.880 --> 14:01.670
<b><i>An onslaught of decoy threads,
hiding a few finer threads that will deal real damage...</i></b>

14:01.960 --> 14:02.960
<b><i>That means...</i></b>

14:02.960 --> 14:04.290
<b>You dodged.</b>

14:04.290 --> 14:06.040
<b>Well, that makes sense.</b>

14:13.130 --> 14:15.500
<b><i>The way he moves, the length of his reach...</i></b>

14:16.040 --> 14:17.540
<b><i>The dexterity of his techniques...</i></b>

14:21.540 --> 14:22.540
<b>Why?</b>

14:22.830 --> 14:24.040
<b>Why?!</b>

14:24.670 --> 14:26.170
<b>How could you do this,</b>

14:26.170 --> 14:27.380
<b>Shadow?!</b>

14:29.420 --> 14:31.080
<b>I have forsaken that name.</b>

14:31.580 --> 14:33.380
<b>Now I am called John Smith!</b>

14:33.960 --> 14:34.960
<b>What?</b>

14:35.460 --> 14:36.670
<b>What have you...</b>

14:37.880 --> 14:39.080
<b>Delta!</b>

14:39.080 --> 14:40.380
<b>What has become of Delta?!</b>

14:41.500 --> 14:43.580
<b>I sent her to a far-off place.</b>

14:47.000 --> 14:48.460
<b>That...</b>

14:49.040 --> 14:50.540
<b>That tells me nothing!</b>

14:52.460 --> 14:55.790
<b>Maybe you can understand it,
but it makes no sense to me!</b>

14:56.290 --> 14:59.630
<b>I'm not capable of doing the things that you can do!</b>

15:00.880 --> 15:02.750
<b>But despite that...</b>

15:03.790 --> 15:07.080
<b>I want to support you.
To understand you!</b>

15:07.580 --> 15:10.210
<b>I want to be there for the man who saved my life.</b>

15:10.580 --> 15:11.790
<b>For you...</b>

15:11.790 --> 15:13.540
<b>If it would serve you, I would...</b>

15:14.580 --> 15:16.790
<b>But you... Does this mean...</b>

15:17.330 --> 15:20.580
<b>You don't need me anymore?</b>

15:26.080 --> 15:28.380
<b>Once it's all over, then you'll understand.</b>

15:28.380 --> 15:30.330
<b>You'll know this was the best choice.</b>

15:32.630 --> 15:34.460
<b>I won't be like this forever, you know.</b>

15:34.830 --> 15:36.420
<b>I won't keep dragging you down!</b>

15:51.210 --> 15:53.080
<b>I can support you, too!</b>

15:53.080 --> 15:54.420
<b>I swear it!</b>

15:56.130 --> 15:57.880
<b><i>Mistform, eh?</i></b>

15:57.880 --> 16:01.500
<b><i>But you still have to solidify
to land an actual attack.</i></b>

16:01.500 --> 16:05.880
<b><i>So yeah, the enemy's attacks won't hit you,
but you could just dodge for that.</i></b>

16:06.210 --> 16:08.790
<b><i>Not enough return for the risk.</i></b>

16:10.290 --> 16:13.790
<b><i>Oh, but when you're all mist, you can fly,
so that could be handy.</i></b>

16:15.170 --> 16:17.040
<b>But mist is lacking in mass.</b>

16:17.630 --> 16:18.830
<b>Lightweight!</b>

16:38.000 --> 16:39.920
<b>No, come back...</b>

16:40.580 --> 16:43.540
<b>Please don't leave me...</b>

16:47.250 --> 16:49.170
<b>How do you like it, Mr. Smith?</b>

16:49.540 --> 16:50.830
<b>It's magnificent.</b>

16:51.250 --> 16:54.330
<b>We have exchanged almost all of
the counterfeit bills for gold.</b>

16:54.330 --> 16:58.380
<b>At this point in time, the coffers of the
Major Corporate Alliance may as well be empty.</b>

16:58.710 --> 17:01.710
<b>I've been carefully accumulating authentic banknotes.</b>

17:01.710 --> 17:04.710
<b>Now all that remains to be done is to cash them
where the entire public can see,</b>

17:04.710 --> 17:06.540
<b>and the MCA will be finished.</b>

17:06.960 --> 17:10.330
<b>Already, people feel anxious keeping
paper bills in their possession.</b>

17:10.330 --> 17:13.380
<b>The citizens will race each other
to redeem their money.</b>

17:13.380 --> 17:16.540
<b>The MCA's supply of funds will fail to
meet the demand, and it will be ruined.</b>

17:16.540 --> 17:21.040
<b>In no time at all, the ripples will spread
and affect Mitsugoshi, as well.</b>

17:21.290 --> 17:23.460
<b>Not even Mitsugoshi will have the funds</b>

17:23.460 --> 17:26.960
<b>to exchange all of the bills that have been
circulating through the marketplace.</b>

17:27.330 --> 17:32.170
<b>The businesses that have upheld all of the kingdom's
economic activity will fall like dominoes,</b>

17:32.170 --> 17:35.830
<b>and the government will have its hands full
as it attempts to quell the chaos.</b>

17:36.080 --> 17:42.000
<b>That will be our chance to destroy all of the
evidence and vanish without a trace.</b>

17:42.250 --> 17:43.500
<b>Indeed.</b>

17:43.500 --> 17:46.790
<b>The total amount of currency in circulation has
increased by the addition of the counterfeit bills,</b>

17:46.790 --> 17:48.210
<b>and prices have gone up.</b>

17:48.540 --> 17:50.920
<b>These circumstances can easily lead to inflation,</b>

17:50.920 --> 17:54.960
<b>and it has already reached a point that it
must be addressed at a state level.</b>

17:55.380 --> 17:57.460
<b>This will be the perfect time to end it.</b>

17:57.460 --> 17:59.540
<b>You saw that far ahead!</b>

17:59.540 --> 18:01.290
<b>I am impressed, as always.</b>

18:01.630 --> 18:05.540
<b>We could never have succeeded in this plan
without your help, Mr. Smith.</b>

18:06.290 --> 18:08.290
<b>Surely, I can't take all the credit.</b>

18:08.290 --> 18:10.170
<b>Oh, you flatter me.</b>

18:12.460 --> 18:14.670
<b>I believe I've told you before...</b>

18:14.920 --> 18:19.210
<b>about when I was young,
and I lived in the village with my mother.</b>

18:20.630 --> 18:24.330
<b>Back then, the great hero Shiva had just fallen,</b>

18:24.330 --> 18:27.080
<b>and the therianthrope lands were plunged
into a maelstrom of war.</b>

18:28.330 --> 18:32.380
<b>The powerful clans were in constant conflict
to claim the crown of the great hero,</b>

18:32.710 --> 18:37.580
<b>and the weaker clans, like my Spirit Fox clan,
were constantly at their mercy.</b>

18:38.330 --> 18:40.080
<b>In our quest for survival,</b>

18:40.080 --> 18:44.330
<b>we attempted to deepen our ties with the
like-minded clans to whom we were allied.</b>

18:44.330 --> 18:45.960
<b>It seemed like the natural course of action.</b>

18:46.460 --> 18:50.460
<b>The powerful clan of the Great Wolves and
the wise clan of the Spirit Foxes...</b>

18:50.920 --> 18:54.540
<b>Two were chosen to marry in order
to strengthen our alliance:</b>

18:54.540 --> 18:58.630
<b>myself, the daughter of the only
Spirit Fox to have three tails;</b>

18:58.630 --> 19:02.580
<b>and the son of Great Wolves' patriarch,
the swordsman Gettan.</b>

19:07.420 --> 19:11.830
<b>I admired Gettan, and accepted
my appointment with joy.</b>

19:12.460 --> 19:14.920
<b>And Gettan had affection for me, too.</b>

19:15.630 --> 19:19.000
<b>My mother and everyone in the village
gave us their blessing.</b>

19:19.000 --> 19:21.000
<b>It was such a happy time.</b>

19:23.330 --> 19:24.540
<b>But then...</b>

19:28.170 --> 19:31.080
<b>Strife broke out nearby between two great clans.</b>

19:31.080 --> 19:35.170
<b>Our village was caught in the crossfire,
and just like that, it was destroyed.</b>

19:35.830 --> 19:40.290
<b>The wisdom and strength of the lesser clans
amounted to nothing more than helplessness.</b>

19:43.540 --> 19:45.830
<b>I made a proposal to the others.</b>

19:46.580 --> 19:49.750
<b>I told them the only way to survive
is to accept more power.</b>

19:50.080 --> 19:53.710
<b>If we take these pills,
they will grant us immense power.</b>

19:53.710 --> 19:56.130
<b>We could have stood against the greater clans.</b>

19:56.130 --> 19:58.880
<b>We could have broken out of
this constant state of war.</b>

19:58.880 --> 20:00.880
<b>But that woman refused.</b>

20:00.880 --> 20:03.170
<b>Because of her, they all refused!</b>

20:03.170 --> 20:04.670
<b>They all died!</b>

20:04.670 --> 20:07.420
<b>We could have stopped this before it happened!</b>

20:08.670 --> 20:10.290
<b>Yes, that's right.</b>

20:10.830 --> 20:13.580
<b>I did that; I killed her.</b>

20:13.580 --> 20:17.420
<b>I had to do it, to protect you from this war.</b>

20:17.920 --> 20:19.170
<b>Gettan...</b>

20:19.170 --> 20:22.670
<b>The only way to stop them taking from us
is to start taking from them.</b>

20:23.040 --> 20:24.040
<b>Gettan!</b>

20:24.040 --> 20:25.040
<b>Come now...</b>

20:25.040 --> 20:28.960
<b>Pledge fealty to the Cult,
and accept their power for yourself.</b>

20:29.710 --> 20:31.330
<b>Gettan!</b>

20:32.460 --> 20:34.500
<b>You, too?</b>

20:36.080 --> 20:38.960
<b>You dare reject me?!</b>

20:46.170 --> 20:49.380
<b>If I don't take from them, they'll take from me.</b>

20:50.080 --> 20:53.830
<b>If I don't take from them, they'll take from me.</b>

20:54.630 --> 20:56.330
<b>If I don't take from them...</b>

21:07.130 --> 21:10.380
<b>He took everything from me,</b>

21:10.380 --> 21:13.540
<b>leaving me with nothing but an archnemesis: Gettan.</b>

21:13.960 --> 21:16.210
<b>I ended up as a prostitute on the battlefield.</b>

21:16.210 --> 21:17.500
<b>I needed wealth.</b>

21:17.500 --> 21:18.710
<b>I needed power.</b>

21:18.710 --> 21:21.040
<b>I used everything I possibly could,</b>

21:21.040 --> 21:24.210
<b>until I found myself in the Lawless City
and climbed to the top.</b>

21:25.920 --> 21:28.170
<b>Surely you have caught on, Mr. Smith.</b>

21:28.750 --> 21:32.960
<b>You know that my true objective is
not to build myself a fortune.</b>

21:33.710 --> 21:36.460
<b>My real goal is to find Gettan and take everything</b>

21:36.460 --> 21:39.330
<b>Maybe it was that thing with Senpai...
</b><b>and take everything that he has built up for himself.</b><b></b>

21:40.130 --> 21:42.000
<b>I'm going to settle this now.</b>

21:42.460 --> 21:45.880
<b>I do hope you will wait for my return,
trusting in my success.</b>

22:18.420 --> 22:22.290
<b>An endlessly deep dark night
</b><b>Doko made mo fukai yamiyo to</b><b></b>

22:22.290 --> 22:25.130
<b>I thought, as I closed my eyes
</b><b>Omotte me o tsubutteta</b><b></b>

22:25.130 --> 22:30.290
<b>Still unaware of the voice of the star calling out to me
</b><b>Yobikakeru hoshi no koe ni kizukenai mama</b><b></b>

22:30.670 --> 22:34.670
<b>A faint light, not too bright
</b><b>Mabushiku wa nai awai hi</b><b></b>

22:34.670 --> 22:37.420
<b>But comforting, that's how you were
</b><b>Kokochi ii sonna anata o</b><b></b>

22:37.420 --> 22:41.290
<b>Before I knew it, I was following you with my eyes
</b><b>Shiranu uchi ni me de oikaketa</b><b></b>

22:41.290 --> 22:43.880
<b>Even if I run out of breath
</b><b>Iki o kirashite</b><b></b>

22:44.290 --> 22:47.330
<b>And start to stumble
</b><b>Motsuresou ni natte mo</b><b></b>

22:47.330 --> 22:49.580
<b>I've never felt this before
</b><b>Kono kimochi wa hajimete</b><b></b>

22:49.580 --> 22:53.500
<b>I can't stop the feeling
</b><b>Mita koto no nai jibun ni aeru</b><b></b>

22:53.880 --> 22:57.330
<b>That I can meet a me I've never seen before
</b><b>Yokan ga tomaranai</b><b></b>

22:57.830 --> 23:00.750
<b>I run down the path in front of me
</b><b>Me no mae no michi o hashiru</b><b></b>

23:00.750 --> 23:03.830
<b>I run far, even when I'm lost
</b><b>Tooku, mayotte mo</b><b></b>

23:03.830 --> 23:07.670
<b>If I look up, you won't have changed
</b><b>Miagereba anata wa kawaranaide</b><b></b>

23:07.670 --> 23:10.000
<b>You'll be there
</b><b>Soko ni iru koto o</b><b></b>

23:10.000 --> 23:12.960
<b>It may be strange, but I can believe it
</b><b>Fushigi demo shinjirareru</b><b></b>

23:12.960 --> 23:16.040
<b>Kaze ga tsuyoi hi mo
</b><b>Even on windy days</b><b></b>

23:16.040 --> 23:20.540
<b>I don't have to try to reach over you
</b><b>Over you todokeyou to shinakutatte ii</b><b></b>

23:20.540 --> 23:22.880
<b>Hey (Did you know?)
</b><b>Nee (Shitteru?)</b><b></b>

23:22.880 --> 23:25.920
<b>As all the stars revolve
</b><b>Subete no hoshi ga mawarinagara</b><b></b>

23:25.920 --> 23:29.170
<b>I keep my sights on you
</b><b>Anata o mezashiteru</b><b></b>

23:29.170 --> 23:32.130
<b>Polaris in the Night</b>
